    "Make a newly bound Project inherit the existing identical Item, MBOM, Tool Asset, Trial Summary and Engineering Change test profiles, without introducing dual-master fields.",
    "Prove ERPNext v15 and v16 compatibility, pass the complete Level 3 release gate, deploy only to LaunchFlow and ERPNext-test after backups, and run a real test-environment Project exchange using existing authorized data."
  ],
  "non_scope": [
    "No production ERPNext or JCE-Core contact or mutation and no claim of production activation.",
    "No Frappe or ERPNext core patch, cross-database access, generic DocType writer, credential disclosure, temporary administrator permission or test backdoor.",
    "No dual-master ownership: ERPNext remains authoritative for formal Project and Item identities and manufacturing execution; NPI remains authoritative for NPI engineering process truth.",
    "No fabricated business records solely to make an empty feature appear populated, and no Entra tenant configuration change.",
